  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Added AnyOfLikeStructure ToString() override. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Added AddMissingPathParameters setting that true by default. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Updated System.Text.Json to 9.0.3 2025-03-21\n- feat(cli): initial version of generation .http files from openapi 2025-03-06\n- feat: ApiExceptions now will show json instead ReasonPhrase for all possible cases. 2025-02-28\n- feat: Now need to mark all SourceGenerator AdditionalFiles with AutoSDK_OpenApiSpecification = true explicitly. 2025-02-26\n- feat: Improved generation for TargetFramework=net9. 2025-02-07\n- feat: Added some default JsonSerializerContextTypes. 2025-01-07\n- feat: Added Cohere AllOf inheritance/polymorphism support. 2024-12-18\n- feat: Added x-enum-descriptions support. 2024-12-07\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Add missing analyzer dependencies 2025-05-08\n- fix: Add missing dependencies for analyzers 2025-05-08\n- fix: Revert 3 2025-05-07\n- fix: Remove PolySharp usage. 2025-05-07\n- fix: Try to fix Source Generators 3. 2025-05-07\n- fix: Try to fix VS Source Generation issue 2 2025-05-07\n- fix: Try to fix Source Generators in VS 2025-05-07\n- fix: Remove propertyNames from OpenAPI 3.1 specs 2025-04-17\n- fix: Fixed missing specific exceptions when endpoint does not return anything. 2025-04-10\n- fix: Fixed ultravox bug. 2025-04-10",
